  "attributes": [
    {"id":"member.current_tier","entityVersion":{"entity":"MEMBER","schemaVersion":"1.2"},"subject":"MEMBER","displayName":"会员当前等级","dataType":"ORDERED_ENUM","aliases":["会员等级","卡级","当前等级"],"enumValues":[{"code":"STANDARD","aliases":["10","普卡","普通会员"],"rank":10},{"code":"SILVER","aliases":["20","Silver","银卡"],"rank":20},{"code":"GOLD","aliases":["30","Gold","金卡"],"rank":30},{"code":"PLATINUM","aliases":["40","Platinum","白金卡"],"rank":40}],"disambiguation":"当前等级是有序枚举 ORDERED_ENUM，不是无序 ENUM；rank 越大等级越高：10=普卡、20=银卡、30=金卡、40=白金卡。支持等于、不等于、IN、NOT_IN、大于、大于等于、小于、小于等于、BETWEEN 和空值判断。完整示例：‘当前等级金卡以上’输出 operator=GREATER_OR_EQUAL、value=GOLD，Resolver 展开为 IN[GOLD,PLATINUM]；‘当前等级白金卡以上’展开为 IN[PLATINUM]；‘当前等级银卡以下’输出 LESS_OR_EQUAL、value=SILVER，展开为 IN[STANDARD,SILVER]。"},
    {"id":"tier_history.tier","entityVersion":{"entity":"EVENT","schemaVersion":"1.3"},"subject":"EVENT","displayName":"历史会员等级","dataType":"ORDERED_ENUM","aliases":["历史卡级","曾经等级"],"enumValues":[{"code":"STANDARD","aliases":["10","普卡","普通会员"],"rank":10},{"code":"SILVER","aliases":["20","Silver","银卡"],"rank":20},{"code":"GOLD","aliases":["30","Gold","金卡"],"rank":30},{"code":"PLATINUM","aliases":["40","Platinum","白金卡"],"rank":40}],"disambiguation":"历史等级是有序枚举 ORDERED_ENUM，rank 越大等级越高；一条记录表示一个等级生效区间，区间查询必须同时保留 effective_from 和 effective_to。等级比较支持等于、不等于、集合、大小和 BETWEEN，并由 Resolver 按 rank 确定性展开。"},
